{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2L1NhY3JpZmljZSUyMCUyODIwMTYlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Sacrifice","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eVrlNY7SbWmTslaRlJvo3sMsZm4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5hmW7NJaWBpUS4GMmUsiqWGjDAI.jpg","description":"Sacrifice is the story of consultant surgeon, Tora Hamilton, who moves with her husband, Duncan, to the remote Shetland Islands, 100 miles off the north-east coast of Scotland. Deep in the peat soil around her new home, Tora discovers the body of a young woman with rune marks carved into her skin and a gaping hole where her heart once beat. Ignoring warnings to leave well alone, Tora uncovers terrifying links to a legend that might never have been confined to the pages of the story-books.","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Thriller","Crime","Mystery","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.4","runtime":"91 min","cast":["Radha Mitchell","Rupert Graves","Ian McElhinney","David Robb","Joanne Crawford","Liam Carney","Declan Conlon","Peter Vollebregt"],"director":["Peter A. Dowling"],"released":"2016-04-29T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Every life has a price","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Radha Mitchell","character":"Dr. Tora Hamilton","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8EVKyEkwPfIA6GxlIo0PJv0A5mm.jpg"},{"name":"Rupert Graves","character":"Duncan Guthrie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6tS8XMuTS04xXTfeWFjJED6SFBF.jpg"},{"name":"Ian McElhinney","character":"D.I. McKie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gnXsOpML4CKDvPuAg8erDo9S57h.jpg"},{"name":"David Robb","character":"Richard Guthrie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sM4BI80TD4lcVOfxA7UOHO6Wzzx.jpg"},{"name":"Joanne Crawford","character":"Sgt. Dana Tulloch","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qTbAW8kwFIM21d8Z4smemubqo3z.jpg"},{"name":"Liam Carney","character":"Mr. Grey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ylXqOxfNMPFXSJQJ3BOrGho2rHp.jpg"},{"name":"Declan Conlon","character":"Steph